{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109810","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109810/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109810/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109810/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109810","id":3339347425,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc7HCmXh","number":109810,"title":"Window node's 'ExcludeFromCapture' flag doesn't exclude window contents with DisplayServer.ScreenGetImage","user":{"login":"julia-maliauka","id":107166014,"node_id":"U_kgDOBmM5Pg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107166014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka","html_url":"https://github.com/julia-maliauka","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-08-20T19:47:54Z","updated_at":"2025-08-21T09:16:43Z","closed_at":"2025-08-20T21:23:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.4.1-stable\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable.mono (49a5bc7b6) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090 Laptop GPU (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7700) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13980HX (32 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nI am implementing a camera feature where the player can take photos of the world, but UI nodes need to be excluded from these screenshots.\n\nI capture the screenshot using: \n\n`var image = DisplayServer.ScreenGetImage(screenIndex);`\n\nAll of my UI is beneath a Window node with 'ExcludeFromCapture' enabled. Theoretically, this should prevent it from being included in screenshots, but I still see the widgets in the final images.\n\n---\n\n<img width=\"1825\" height=\"247\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/98108856-ba78-4f56-a2fc-779553d9ed32\" /> \n\n<img width=\"890\" height=\"915\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ce1e853a-8af3-4f9c-84af-6acb52cedcb2\" />\n\n<img width=\"591\" height=\"214\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c6178577-b8a4-4ed8-924c-3b215851a8be\" />\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a Window node\n2. In the Window node's settings, enable `ExcludeFromCapture`\n3. Add a RichTextLabel or ColorRect as a child of the Window\n4. In playmode, take a screenshot using `var image = DisplayServer.ScreenGetImage(screenIndex);`\n\nExpected Result: The UI beneath the Window node should not be visible in the screen capture.\nActual Result: The UI is there, along with all the other nodes in the scene.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21904289/mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"julia-maliauka","id":107166014,"node_id":"U_kgDOBmM5Pg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/107166014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka","html_url":"https://github.com/julia-maliauka","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/julia-maliauka/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109810/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109810/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}